                                                "sense_id": "d3740722-bc8e-341b-b60c-a7e86417a222",
                                                "text": "If Brit joins Common Market . . .; terms for Brit's entry agreed upon, U S will face new econ, political, defense problems when Brit joins EEC; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6993fbb9-76f3-4b78-b152-0c995626eb4f",
