                                                "text": "Worked extensively in Brit and USA on behaviour of biol fluids, particularly blood, also lectured in Brit, Germany, Sweden, Japan, Can, USA, 1960s; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5700f282-2c86-4c2c-b5a4-d8f5787b6adc",
                                                "sense_id": "d3740722-bc8e-341b-b60c-a7e86417a222",
